  "review_instructions": [
    "Review every fixture ID, intended label, rationale, and output text.",
    "Confirm acceptable fixtures preserve the source-grounded meaning and requested output structure.",
    "Confirm regression fixtures are well formed but materially worse for the stated failure mode.",
    "Request edits for ambiguous examples; do not approve the directory partially without recording exclusions.",
    "Promote only explicitly approved fixtures into test/fixtures/drift_spike/approved/."
  ],
  "known_limitations": [
    "Pure synthetic batches cycle a small reviewed fixture pool to reach 20 samples, which can amplify repetition-related lexical signals.",
    "Mixed batches avoid that confound for unaffected samples by replacing selected outputs in a fresh held-out control run.",
    "These fixtures test controlled failure modes and do not establish generalization to arbitrary customer prompts."
  ]
